# The Postman Always KO's Twice (windurst 19): Ambrosius, Orudoba-Sondeba, Tsuaora-Tsuora (Windurst Walls; no default
# action, no container). The four letters are rare (one each held): GM `item` steps give them again between trades.
# Available: Orudoba-Sondeba 43, Tsuaora-Tsuora 42 (their scripts); Ambrosius 48, option 1: nothing; a letter: nothing;
# 48, option 0: begun. Accepted: 49; Orudoba-Sondeba 51, Tsuaora-Tsuora 50; a letter and another item: nothing (count 2,
# one point); the four: 55 (500, 4): the four taken, 500 gil, fame 10, completed. Completed: 56; Orudoba-Sondeba 43,
# Tsuaora-Tsuora 42; one / two / three / four letters: 57 (50) / 58 (150, 2) / 59 (250, 3) /
# 60 (500, 4): taken, the gil, fame 10. Set accepted again (GMs): one letter: 52 (50): completed;
# again, two: 53 (150, 2); again, three: 54 (250, 3).
char zone=WindurstWalls pos=63.5,-2.5,-63.2 job=WAR lvl=75
item TornEpistle
item MuddyBarTab
item OddPostcard
item DampEnvelope
item BlockOfAnimalGlue
login
